{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26192","headline":"春色满皇州 · 滕迈","name":"春色满皇州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼复悠悠，春归十二楼。\n最明云里阙，先满日边州。\n色媚青门外，光摇紫陌头。\n上林荣旧树，太液镜新流。\n暧带祥烟起，清添瑞景浮。\n阳和如啓蛰，从此事芳游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"滕迈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}